  "prefLabel": "Env-Wq 1705.03 Restoration Permitting",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Wq 1705.03 Restoration Permitting.\n\n(a) Temporary and infrequent impacts resulting from ecological restoration projects approved by the department shall be exempt from the assimilative capacity requirements of Env-Wq 1705.01 and dilution requirements of Env-Wq 1705.02.\n\n(b) Any water quality or water quantity impacts from ecological restoration projects approved by the department shall be minimized to the extent practicable.\n\nSource. #14203, eff 2-26-25",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-wq1700.html"
